# Cursor publishing

**Not the queue.** A request that mentions «صف انتشار» (prepare an item, publish from the queue, report its status) does not use this rule: `dentcast-router.mdc` names its route document, and that document is read alone.

**LIVE_MODULAR_PUBLISHING_ENABLED.** Read `.dentcast/workflows/README.md`, `.dentcast/workflows/agent-parity.md` and the complete active sections selected for the current edit scope by `.dentcast/workflows/global/README.md`.
Load complete `modules/01-hard-rules.md` and `02-routing-intake.md`, then every applicable rule in the ledger order of `publish-checkpoints.md`: full modules by default, or the verified readpack (README). Never summarize or omit an unverified rule. Preserve source-based DES/Fidelity, category exceptions, English, notification and Phase F. Staging utilities cannot replace real steps. Legacy files are backup only; do not read them for execution.

**Interrupted publication** («انتشار ناقص داشتم»), the run state `.dentcast/PUBLISH-HANDOFF.md` and recovery through `.dentcast/workflows/publish-handoff.md`: `.dentcast/workflows/publish-checkpoints.md`, «Interrupted publication».

Ledger, founder messages, the three fixed deliveries, hosting, waits and merge: `.dentcast/workflows/publish-checkpoints.md`.
